"description":"Dynamic Lyrics is an app that displays real-time lyrics and translations on your lock screen, Dynamic Island, widgets, floating windows, and more. It supports Apple Music and Spotify.\nYou can also use the Shazam mode to identify music playing on any app, webpage, or in your surroundings.\n\n• Lock Screen Lyrics & Dynamic Island Lyrics\nDisplay real-time lyrics on the lock screen and Dynamic Island, enhancing your music experience.\n\n• Lyrics Widget\nShow real-time lyrics on the home screen widget and StandBy mode.\n\n• Floating Lyrics\nDisplay lyrics anywhere using a floating window.\n\n• Supports Lyrics Translation\nTranslate lyrics into any supported language, breaking down language barriers.\n\n• Supports Multiple Music Apps\nSeamlessly compatible with Apple Music and Spotify for a smooth experience.\n\n• Shazam Mode\nWith Shazam mode, you can identify music playing on any app, webpage, or in your surroundings and view the lyrics.\n\n• Lyrics Sharing\nShare beautiful lyrics cards effortlessly with friends.\n\nDynamic Lyrics® Membership Description:\nBy becoming a Dynamic Lyrics® member, you can unlock all premium features, enjoy free updates in the future, and benefit from an ad-free experience.\nYou can choose between a subscription or a lifetime membership with a one-time payment.\nIf you choose a subscription, it will automatically renew through your iTunes account.\nYour Apple iTunes account will be charged within 24 hours before the current period ends, and the subscription will renew for the next cycle.\nTo cancel the renewal, please manually turn off the auto-renewal option in your Apple ID settings at least 24 hours before the current subscription period ends.\nIf you do not cancel during the trial period, the subscription will automatically activate and charge you at the end of the trial.\nThis service is entirely optional. If you choose not to cancel, the next billing period will renew automatically.\nPrivacy Policy: https://musiclyrics.cn/privacy.html\nUser Agreement: https://musiclyrics.cn/agreement.html", "trackCensoredName":"Dynamic-Lyrics", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dynamic-lyrics/id6476125287?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.28068999999999988403942552395164966583251953125, "languageCodesISO2A":["AR", "EN", "FR", "JA", "KO", "ZH", "ES", "ZH"], "fileSizeBytes":"35712000", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":8985, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.28068999999999988403942552395164966583251953125, "userRatingCount":8985}]
